WEBVTT

00:02.480 --> 00:04.400
That was a good sleep.

00:06.110 --> 00:08.240
Top of the morning, Sis.

00:08.740 --> 00:10.869
You too, Pina.
Did you take a bath?

00:11.410 --> 00:12.990
Yeah.

00:14.830 --> 00:16.790
Your hair is still wet.

00:16.790 --> 00:20.500
Drying it out is a hassle.
Do it for me, please.

00:20.500 --> 00:23.215
Fine, I'll help you.

00:26.920 --> 00:29.096
Say, Pina.

00:29.630 --> 00:33.390
Ein hasn't woken up.
Do you think he's all right?

00:33.390 --> 00:35.810
You're worrying too much, Sis.

00:35.810 --> 00:39.140
He's just exhausted.
Mother said so too, didn't she?

00:39.600 --> 00:41.020
I know.

00:41.020 --> 00:42.400
But still...

00:42.400 --> 00:44.020
I have an idea!

00:44.021 --> 00:48.531
How about we cook something to
help him get better?

00:49.400 --> 00:51.780
That's a good idea!

00:51.780 --> 00:53.320
Now that it's decided,

00:53.320 --> 00:55.280
it's time to go shopping!

00:55.280 --> 00:59.040
It's been forever since
we went out together.

00:59.040 --> 01:02.210
I'm not sure if we should
be away from Ein, though.

01:02.210 --> 01:03.920
It might be dangerous outside.

01:03.920 --> 01:05.800
We'll be fine, all right.

01:05.800 --> 01:09.550
It's not like we're going to
run into some big accident or anything.

01:10.380 --> 01:12.050
Yeah.

01:13.510 --> 01:16.510
If only he weren't around...

01:16.510 --> 01:19.810
If you'd like to,
I can lend you my strength.

01:19.810 --> 01:20.680
Huh?

01:20.680 --> 01:23.520
My name is Echidna.

01:23.520 --> 01:25.820
I am a spirit.

01:25.820 --> 01:29.190
Echidna? A spirit?

01:29.190 --> 01:31.320
What do you want from me?!

01:31.320 --> 01:37.240
It seems that you hold a deep grudge
against a certain appraiser.

01:41.120 --> 01:45.880
♪I'm not going to lose,
because I believe in myself♪

01:45.880 --> 01:50.920
♪I'll do whatever it takes
to protect that miracle♪

01:50.920 --> 02:00.680
(Even Given the Worthless "Appraiser" Class,
I'm Actually the Strongest)

02:01.020 --> 02:05.190
♪A fleeting dream I had is falling now♪

02:05.730 --> 02:09.530
♪The loneliness remains as my power♪

02:10.650 --> 02:14.610
♪To a life that is drifting away♪

02:14.610 --> 02:17.830
♪The magic sprinkles upon♪

02:19.240 --> 02:24.000
♪I pick up the fragments
and tightly tether them♪

02:24.000 --> 02:28.630
♪I always keep them as
my source of strength in my heart♪

02:28.630 --> 02:30.920
♪See the world through my eyes♪

02:30.920 --> 02:33.340
♪And you'll get your treasure♪

02:33.340 --> 02:38.760
♪Let's go around the world and find it out♪

02:39.930 --> 02:44.310
♪I'm not going to lose,
because I believe in myself♪

02:44.810 --> 02:49.360
♪Everything's possible
I've overcome a lot so far♪

02:49.360 --> 02:54.360
♪Because you have given it to me♪

02:54.360 --> 03:01.160
♪I'll do whatever it takes
to protect that miracle, for good♪

03:17.010 --> 03:21.220
Huh? Where am I?

03:22.930 --> 03:25.230
Hurry up and move it, Ein!

03:27.600 --> 03:30.569
Man, you're slow as heck.

03:32.480 --> 03:34.990
Haha, my bad.

03:36.820 --> 03:38.076
What...

03:39.070 --> 03:41.160
What are you doing?!

03:44.410 --> 03:46.918
Here's your share.

03:48.687 --> 03:51.090
Thank you so much, Zoid.

03:52.500 --> 03:54.670
Stop it. Don't laugh!

03:54.670 --> 03:57.220
Be grateful you even got any.

03:57.220 --> 04:02.220
You're not even worth
a single gold coin.

04:02.220 --> 04:07.230
A worthless appraiser like you will never
make it in life, no matter how hard you work.

04:07.230 --> 04:09.232
Know your place!

04:10.190 --> 04:11.190
You're wrong!

04:28.120 --> 04:31.213
This could have been my life.

04:32.420 --> 04:36.840
If I hadn't met Yuri,
this would have been my fate.

04:36.840 --> 04:40.090
You just happen to have good luck.

04:41.590 --> 04:44.600
It's just because you got
the Spirit's Eye by chance.

04:44.600 --> 04:47.850
You're not that strong yourself.

04:47.850 --> 04:52.100
A piece of rubbish will always remain
rubbish, no matter how much it struggles!

04:52.100 --> 04:55.100
It doesn't change who you really are!

04:58.740 --> 05:01.110
You okay, brat?

05:01.110 --> 05:02.610
Ursula?

05:02.610 --> 05:04.120
Huh? Where are we?

05:05.200 --> 05:09.410
Wait, what happened after
I met His Majesty the King?

05:09.410 --> 05:12.000
What, you don't remember?

05:12.000 --> 05:15.000
You collapsed from exhaustion
and have been asleep for a while.

05:15.000 --> 05:17.130
Good grief, don't push yourself.

05:17.130 --> 05:18.510
Is that so?

05:18.510 --> 05:20.760
Sorry to trouble you.

05:21.720 --> 05:24.010
Yuri and the others
are also worried.

05:26.010 --> 05:27.260
Where's Yuri?

05:27.260 --> 05:29.180
She went on a
walk to town with Pina.

05:29.180 --> 05:31.310
Will they be alright?

05:31.310 --> 05:35.020
I've got Yuri's location
tracked in real-time.

05:35.020 --> 05:38.110
If anything happens,
I can get to her immediately.

05:38.110 --> 05:39.530
I see.

05:39.530 --> 05:42.110
You should just rest a bit more.

05:42.110 --> 05:44.030
You were groaning in your sleep.

05:44.030 --> 05:47.160
Oh, well, I had a nightmare.

05:48.540 --> 05:49.790
What's that?

05:49.790 --> 05:55.290
My fate changed after I met
Yuri and the others by chance.

05:55.290 --> 05:56.540
Otherwise...

05:56.540 --> 06:01.303
I would have been
Hellhounds' food by now.

06:02.050 --> 06:03.590
I just happened to be lucky.

06:03.590 --> 06:05.890
That's all I am.

06:05.890 --> 06:10.180
I'm here because of
the power everyone lent me.

06:10.180 --> 06:13.730
But my essence remains the same.

06:13.730 --> 06:16.690
I'm still the same worthless,
rubbish class I always was.

06:17.110 --> 06:18.940
Brat...

06:20.110 --> 06:22.440
Zoid is right, after all.

06:25.410 --> 06:27.320
Please tell me once more.

06:27.320 --> 06:28.760
As I said,

06:28.761 --> 06:34.210
I may be able to assist you in taking
revenge on the appraiser you despise.

06:34.210 --> 06:36.830
W-What?! Is that even possible?

06:37.420 --> 06:40.090
Have you heard about the Spirit's Eye?

06:40.090 --> 06:41.510
The Spirit's Eye?

06:41.510 --> 06:42.590
Exactly.

06:42.590 --> 06:45.300
The Appraiser that
you despise so much...

06:45.300 --> 06:47.390
...also has that eye, you know.

06:47.390 --> 06:48.600
Ein has it?

06:48.600 --> 06:49.510
Yes.

06:49.510 --> 06:54.310
Thanks to that eye, he became the
strongest without even lifting a finger.

06:54.310 --> 06:58.230
So that's why he's
suddenly become so strong.

06:59.440 --> 07:01.400
I always knew it was strange.

07:01.400 --> 07:05.110
There's no way that bottom-feeder could've
gotten strong through legitimate means!

07:05.110 --> 07:06.820
You're right.

07:06.820 --> 07:08.870
I couldn't agree more.

07:08.870 --> 07:12.620
Don't you want one for yourself?
The Spirit's Eye?

07:12.620 --> 07:15.370
I do. Give it to me!

07:24.420 --> 07:28.220
So this is the Spirit's Eye?

07:28.220 --> 07:30.640
With this, I can get
my revenge on that bastard.

07:59.000 --> 08:01.590
Now, go on out there, boy.

08:10.720 --> 08:12.510
My body feels so light.

08:12.510 --> 08:16.230
It's like I have shed my
heavy human shell!

08:20.230 --> 08:23.230
I can feel power surging
from deep within me!

08:23.231 --> 08:25.981
So this is the Spirit's Eye's power?

08:28.900 --> 08:30.490
Jolene...

08:33.740 --> 08:35.620
What on earth is that thing?!

08:35.620 --> 08:36.500
Why is it roaming—

08:42.582 --> 08:45.210
What now, Jolene.

08:45.210 --> 08:48.510
Your bodyguard is no more.

08:48.510 --> 08:51.640
That voice...
Is that you, Zoid?

08:51.640 --> 08:53.010
Are you Zoid?!

08:53.975 --> 08:56.390
I'm sorry for everything!

08:56.390 --> 08:58.100
I'll apologize for all of it...

08:58.100 --> 09:00.020
R-Right.

09:00.020 --> 09:05.528
I'll even tell the guild that I cast
Paralysis on Ein of my own accord.

09:07.197 --> 09:10.530
Also, he's not
my boyfriend or anything.

09:11.110 --> 09:14.030
He threatened to kill me
if I didn't become his woman!

09:16.700 --> 09:19.160
I-I'll do whatever you want.
If you wish, I can be y-your wo—

09:32.220 --> 09:34.010
I have to work hard.

09:34.010 --> 09:35.510
Huh?

09:35.510 --> 09:37.430
What's with you all of a sudden?

09:42.600 --> 09:45.520
I don't want to just
be protected all the time.

09:47.230 --> 09:50.990
I want to give something back to him!

09:51.533 --> 09:53.240
Big Sis...

09:54.870 --> 09:55.620
Huh?

09:55.620 --> 09:57.870
What was that?

09:57.870 --> 09:59.808
A monster!

09:59.809 --> 10:01.500
There's a monster in the town!

10:03.710 --> 10:05.000
Big Sis?!

10:06.630 --> 10:07.790
Are you all right?

10:07.791 --> 10:09.278
It hurts!

10:10.010 --> 10:11.510
I'll heal you right away!

10:16.510 --> 10:19.100
Wait? Huh? The pain is gone?

10:19.100 --> 10:20.600
Can you run by yourself?

10:20.600 --> 10:21.600
I can, but...

10:21.600 --> 10:23.520
How about you?

10:23.520 --> 10:25.810
I'll be fine.

10:25.810 --> 10:29.070
I'll escape as soon as
I heal the injured.

10:29.070 --> 10:30.820
Now, come on.
Get going now.

10:30.820 --> 10:33.030
Thank you so much.

10:35.610 --> 10:37.490
I'll heal you right away.

10:43.710 --> 10:46.000
Enough playing with the small fries.

10:46.000 --> 10:48.170
First, you have to hunt the spirits.

10:48.170 --> 10:49.290
Hunt the spirits?

10:49.290 --> 10:50.210
Yes.

10:50.210 --> 10:51.630
By killing the spirits,

10:51.630 --> 10:55.220
that appraiser won't be able
to use their power.

10:55.220 --> 10:56.430
Once that's the case...

10:57.510 --> 11:00.680
Ein will return to
the small fry he once was.

11:00.680 --> 11:03.310
You're fine now.

11:03.310 --> 11:05.020
You saved me.

11:11.070 --> 11:12.570
Die.

11:13.150 --> 11:15.070
Barrier!

11:15.070 --> 11:16.950
We're escaping, Big Sis!

11:23.119 --> 11:27.962
Zoid, attacking recklessly
won't break a barrier spell.

11:28.960 --> 11:33.880
Now is the time to use the power
I gave you to cancel the spirit power...

11:33.880 --> 11:36.340
The Anti-Spirit Art!

11:45.180 --> 11:47.020
Now, go chase them!

11:51.020 --> 11:52.570
No way.

11:53.570 --> 11:55.070
You!

12:01.120 --> 12:04.950
I can't believe he broke
my barrier so easily...

12:13.000 --> 12:14.710
Run away, Pina!

12:14.710 --> 12:16.010
Big Sis...

12:25.390 --> 12:27.140
What a foolish woman you are.

12:27.600 --> 12:31.020
I can't believe you're giving
that small fry your power.

12:31.020 --> 12:34.980
You can blame him for your death!

12:35.690 --> 12:37.400
Ein...

12:43.910 --> 12:45.790
Are you all right, Yuri, Pina?

12:45.790 --> 12:47.290
- Ein!
- Mister!

12:47.290 --> 12:48.210
Pina!

12:48.210 --> 12:50.170
Sorry for getting here late.

12:50.580 --> 12:53.080
Mother, Ein...

12:53.080 --> 12:54.840
I have faith in you both.

12:54.840 --> 12:57.420
Despite being frightened,

12:57.420 --> 12:59.970
she gave her best to protect her younger sister.

13:00.550 --> 13:02.010
Everyone, into the eye.

13:03.680 --> 13:05.977
I'll have to take care of this thing.

13:06.600 --> 13:07.600
Appraise!

13:08.890 --> 13:10.599
(Chimera (?) - *>EW】 is artificially
created by implanting 【K1 in humans】)

13:10.600 --> 13:11.600
What is this?

13:12.020 --> 13:14.020
I've never seen anything
like this before.

13:14.020 --> 13:16.360
It seems like a "concealment" skill.

13:16.360 --> 13:21.200
But, a technique that can deceive even the
Divine Spirit's Prosthetic Eye...

13:21.200 --> 13:23.370
What's the deal with him?

13:26.410 --> 13:27.120
Parry!

13:32.500 --> 13:33.630
I'll trap him with a barrier!

13:34.420 --> 13:36.040
No! It won't work!

13:38.050 --> 13:39.800
Anti-Spirit Art!

13:43.010 --> 13:44.180
Are you all right?

13:44.590 --> 13:46.100
I'm fine.

13:46.100 --> 13:48.770
He even broke the spirit's barrier...

13:50.640 --> 13:53.310
A barrier of that level...

13:53.310 --> 13:56.190
is meaningless against
my Anti-Spirit Art.

13:56.520 --> 13:58.150
Ein the Appraiser.

13:58.150 --> 14:01.190
Looks like this is it for you.

14:02.990 --> 14:05.410
What? Is that all you've got?

14:05.410 --> 14:07.830
Ein the Rubbish Picker.

14:07.830 --> 14:09.330
How do you know that...

14:09.330 --> 14:11.330
That voice...
Could that be...

14:11.330 --> 14:13.210
Is that you, Zoid?

14:13.210 --> 14:16.000
Took you long enough to realize.

14:16.000 --> 14:17.960
Just like you,

14:17.960 --> 14:21.840
I also received a spirit's blessing
and evolved!

14:22.340 --> 14:24.380
A spirit's blessing?

14:24.380 --> 14:25.800
Just like me?

14:25.800 --> 14:27.970
Don't lose your focus, brat!

14:40.530 --> 14:42.400
Why are you hesitating?

14:42.400 --> 14:44.200
Get hit and you're done for!

14:44.200 --> 14:46.410
Despite what he is now,

14:46.410 --> 14:48.160
he's still...

14:55.040 --> 14:57.040
Isn't my power amazing?

14:59.000 --> 15:03.380
I can't believe you have it too.

15:03.380 --> 15:06.300
But man, you're a weird one.

15:06.300 --> 15:10.010
Why won't you use this
power for yourself?

15:10.010 --> 15:11.310
I mean, look.

15:11.310 --> 15:15.440
Those are the fools that
mocked me and betrayed me.

15:15.440 --> 15:19.690
But now that I've got this
monster-like power with me,

15:19.690 --> 15:23.900
all the things that held me back before
feel like such a joke now.

15:25.110 --> 15:29.320
Ein, we're not so different.
I know you understand.

15:29.320 --> 15:31.330
Zoid, you bastard!

15:31.330 --> 15:35.210
Even if you act like some noble fool,
I can see right through you.

15:35.210 --> 15:38.790
Deep down, you want revenge...

15:38.790 --> 15:41.380
for everything I did to you, right?

15:41.380 --> 15:42.460
Am I wrong?

15:42.460 --> 15:43.630
I would never...

15:43.630 --> 15:44.590
Are you sure?

15:46.010 --> 15:48.590
You never had such a thought
cross your mind?

15:48.590 --> 15:54.100
Back when you were a Low Common,
They all mocked you, didn't they?

15:54.100 --> 15:56.520
"Rubbish picker, rubbish picker!"
they called you.

15:56.520 --> 15:57.350
Stop it.

15:57.350 --> 15:59.940
You're no different
than that monster.

15:59.940 --> 16:01.230
You're wrong.

16:01.230 --> 16:04.730
You and I are the same.

16:06.240 --> 16:08.700
You'll do anything to survive.

16:08.700 --> 16:12.410
You had no pride, no dignity,
the lowest of the low.

16:12.410 --> 16:16.660
Even now, no matter how strong you've gotten,
you're still just a pathetic, desperate human!

16:16.660 --> 16:18.500
Enough of your nonsense!

16:18.500 --> 16:20.750
Ein is nothing like that!

16:20.750 --> 16:22.500
Because I know.

16:22.500 --> 16:25.590
I know for a fact that
he is very kind and strong.

16:25.590 --> 16:27.380
He doesn't let hatred control him!

16:27.380 --> 16:30.090
Hey, Brat.
No, Ein.

16:30.090 --> 16:31.390
You listen to me closely.

16:31.800 --> 16:33.600
You have grown strong!

16:33.600 --> 16:36.640
And I'm not just talking
about your physique.

16:37.640 --> 16:40.310
Your mind and heart
are also well-developed.

16:40.310 --> 16:46.150
You have always used your
power to help those in need.

16:46.150 --> 16:48.820
Have you ever used
your power to hurt the weak?

16:48.820 --> 16:49.990
No!

16:49.990 --> 16:53.660
You said you wanted
to repay Yuri, didn't you?

16:53.660 --> 16:57.790
Your bravery and kindness
are not from Yuri.

16:57.790 --> 16:59.830
You have had those within you all along.

16:59.830 --> 17:02.290
It's something you
nurtured by your own will!

17:02.290 --> 17:03.920
Don't be fooled!

17:03.920 --> 17:07.050
No one knows you better than I do.

17:07.050 --> 17:09.642
Ein.

17:09.642 --> 17:11.510
The fact that I am here right now,

17:11.510 --> 17:14.010
and the fact that I'm
reunited with my family,

17:14.010 --> 17:16.836
is because I've met you.

17:16.836 --> 17:19.020
Meeting you is the reason...

17:19.020 --> 17:21.940
...that my fate has changed as well.

17:22.810 --> 17:23.836
Have I...

17:24.480 --> 17:25.690
Have I...

17:26.164 --> 17:27.836
Have I actually...

17:28.358 --> 17:31.570
Have I actually become strong?

17:34.070 --> 17:36.200
Man, you're noisy.

17:36.200 --> 17:38.330
How long are you going to take your time?

17:38.330 --> 17:42.580
In the end, you're just like me!

17:42.580 --> 17:43.630
That's right.

17:43.630 --> 17:46.000
I'm no different from Zoid.

17:46.000 --> 17:48.630
It will be easier if I just
agree with you, right?

17:48.630 --> 17:49.590
What?

17:49.590 --> 17:53.430
I always thought this world,
where everything is determined by jobs,

17:53.430 --> 17:55.470
was complete nonsense.

17:56.220 --> 17:58.520
Because I was stuck with
a worthless job, and weak,

17:58.520 --> 18:03.230
the strength I gained was thanks to Yuri
and the others, not really my own power.

18:03.230 --> 18:06.980
That's how I kept denying
myself over and over.

18:06.980 --> 18:09.980
Despite who I am,
Yuri still has faith in me.

18:09.980 --> 18:12.490
So does everyone.

18:12.490 --> 18:16.740
If that's the case,
then I will answer to their expectations.

18:17.620 --> 18:22.370
I will become the person
that they have faith in!

18:28.210 --> 18:30.510
What is this surge of mana?

18:30.510 --> 18:34.263
It seems you've finally
become a true protector.

18:35.010 --> 18:38.510
Took you long enough
to realize it, honestly.

18:39.010 --> 18:41.020
I'll never doubt myself again.

18:41.020 --> 18:43.648
I'll become strong enough
to protect everyone!

18:44.270 --> 18:47.690
Now that you have
accepted your own power,

18:47.690 --> 18:51.780
you can finally unleash
the full potential of the spirits' power.

18:51.780 --> 18:53.400
So what?

18:53.400 --> 18:56.160
I will still kill you!

19:01.490 --> 19:03.410
Impossible...

19:03.410 --> 19:06.170
He saw through my
movements perfectly?

19:13.420 --> 19:15.930
Stop! Don't give me that look!

19:15.930 --> 19:17.430
Don't give me that look!

19:17.430 --> 19:18.010
Barrier!

19:18.680 --> 19:19.550
It's futile.

19:19.550 --> 19:20.430
Anti-Spirit Art!

19:22.060 --> 19:23.310
Why...

19:23.310 --> 19:27.730
From what I can see, the blessing
you have received is at most 10%.

19:27.730 --> 19:30.060
You can't beat Ein as he is now.

19:30.060 --> 19:32.320
Dammit, dammit all!

19:32.900 --> 19:36.320
Give me more power, you spirit!

19:43.830 --> 19:45.330
Because I...

19:45.330 --> 19:49.580
I am the strongest, Ein!

19:54.800 --> 19:56.470
I'll put an end to this.

19:56.470 --> 19:59.220
Atone for your sins!

20:17.820 --> 20:18.990
Why...

20:20.620 --> 20:24.870
Even after all that,
why are you still saving me?

20:25.700 --> 20:29.120
I don't need any reason to save people.

20:29.120 --> 20:32.290
That's exactly what pisses me off.

20:32.290 --> 20:35.130
Acting all high and mighty
when you're actually weak!

20:35.130 --> 20:38.420
Does being weak mean
you can't help others?

20:38.420 --> 20:41.140
Does being weak mean
you have to stay miserable?

20:41.720 --> 20:44.101
I'm done running away.

20:45.139 --> 20:47.309
Look, even I can change.

20:47.310 --> 20:50.270
I believe that you will, too, Zoid.

20:51.440 --> 20:55.150
For now, just try taking
the hand in front of you.

20:56.110 --> 20:58.157
That's all it takes.

21:11.540 --> 21:13.880
Someone must have
taken advantage of Zoid's weak heart,

21:13.880 --> 21:17.050
and granted him the
power of the spirits...

21:17.050 --> 21:18.969
But who?

21:19.510 --> 21:21.138
What for?

21:30.180 --> 21:33.690
Ein's battle data retrieval is complete.

21:33.690 --> 21:37.070
As a start to the plan,
things are going smoothly.

21:37.070 --> 21:41.200
The only miscalculation
is that Zoid didn't die.

21:41.200 --> 21:43.700
I've sealed away his memories
of becoming a demon, so...

21:43.700 --> 21:46.580
...the plan will never be exposed.

21:46.580 --> 21:48.080
But still...

21:48.410 --> 21:52.000
Mixing Yuri's purification
power into a slash...

21:52.000 --> 21:54.080
How clever.

21:54.540 --> 21:57.090
Wait for me, Miktoran.

21:57.630 --> 22:01.300
I'll make sure to revive you.

22:09.770 --> 22:14.900
♪No matter what trials you face,
no reason to be in such a hurry♪

22:14.900 --> 22:19.900
♪The wind will never stop carrying on,
as long as you have faith in yourself♪

22:19.900 --> 22:22.320
♪Never give up, the future's just ahead♪

22:22.320 --> 22:25.410
♪Just like rock music that will never die♪

22:28.660 --> 22:30.370
♪Keep on, keep on strumming!♪

22:32.370 --> 22:37.130
♪There are only pointless things
I have to do on my list♪

22:37.130 --> 22:42.010
♪Even the sun of my burning heart
has now completely sank♪

22:42.010 --> 22:47.010
♪I have completely lost track
of my whereabouts♪

22:47.010 --> 22:51.810
♪I wonder where it goes
The very thing I once cherished♪

22:53.100 --> 22:55.560
♪I drowned in hustle and bustle♪

22:55.560 --> 22:57.020
♪In the midst of loneliness♪

22:57.020 --> 23:03.900
♪Every person is being
made aware of reality♪

23:05.990 --> 23:11.200
♪As I was reaching the out of reach
I wasn't sure if I saw a mirage♪

23:11.200 --> 23:15.870
♪As long as you have faith in yourself
The future is possible for you to change♪

23:15.870 --> 23:18.540
♪Even if rocks get in your way forward♪

23:18.540 --> 23:21.130
♪You must stick to your will
and see it through♪

23:21.130 --> 23:26.050
♪Even if, the worst, everything fails
There will definitely be another chance♪

23:26.050 --> 23:28.470
♪The only one to rival is yourself♪

23:28.470 --> 23:31.010
♪Always set your sights
on to rock 'n' goal!♪

23:31.010 --> 23:31.640
(Even Given)

23:31.640 --> 23:32.220
(the Worthless "Appraiser" Class,)

23:32.220 --> 23:32.470
(I'm)

23:32.470 --> 23:32.600
(Actually)

23:32.600 --> 23:32.720
(the Strongest)

23:35.730 --> 23:38.600
Next episode:
The Girl of the Forbidden Archive.

23:38.600 --> 23:40.230
(Next episode:
The Girl of the Forbidden Archive)
